    "date": "2026-10-25",
    "method": "Each app is a shallow clone at its commit. Every package of the version table is written as an exact version in each package.json (solid-js, @solidjs/web, @solidjs/signals, @solidjs/diagnostics, @solidjs/compiler, @solidjs/h and @solidjs/universal 2.0.0-rc.17; @solidjs/router 2.0.0-next.41; @solidjs/vite-plugin 3.0.0-next.51; @solidjs/testing-library 1.0.0-rc.2; @solidjs/start-devtools 1.0.0-next.5; babel-preset-solid 2.0.0-rc.2; @tanstack/solid-query and solid-query-devtools 6.0.0-rc.5; @tanstack/solid-router and solid-start 2.0.0-rc.9; @tanstack/solid-router-devtools 2.0.0-rc.7; @solid-primitives/deep 1.0.0-next.5, map 1.0.0-next.4, mutation-observer 3.0.0-next.4, refs 3.0.0-next.4, rootless 2.0.0-next.4, scroll 3.0.0-next.7, static-store 1.0.0-next.5, transition-group 2.0.0-next.4, virtual 1.0.0-next.6; storybook-solidjs-vite 10.7.4; @sinhong2011/solid-drawer 0.1.4). @solidjs/signals rc.17 is pinned by override (npm `overrides`, bun `overrides`, yarn `resolutions`, pnpm `overrides` in the install root's pnpm-workspace.yaml) because it is transitive and a caret on a prerelease floats to rc.18. Installs run in `installDir` with lifecycle scripts disabled: pnpm `install --no-frozen-lockfile --ignore-scripts`, bun `install --ignore-scripts --minimum-release-age=0`, npm `install --ignore-scripts --no-audit --no-fund`, yarn 4.18.0 `install --no-immutable --mode=skip-build` with YARN_NPM_MINIMAL_AGE_GATE=0 and YARN_ENABLE_GLOBAL_CACHE=0. viviana-ui-web also sets `allowUnusedPatches: true`.",
    "comparability": "Fresh installs resolve newer transitive dependencies, so sweep totals on the rebuilt corpus are not comparable with totals recorded before 2026-10-25; only sweeps on the rebuilt corpus compare with each other."
  },
